  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "英語發音與聽力練習",
    "sub_ename": "ENGLISH PRONUNCIATION AND LISTENING PRACTICE",
    "describe_ch": "加強學生在英語發音和英語聽解之基礎能力，利用課堂上教授的眾多技巧，例如閱讀詩篇以及英語歌曲聽寫等方式增進其基礎能力。學生也能學習利用其他相關的技巧與教材強化他們發音與聽力技能。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is aimed at enhancing students’ basic abilities in English pronunciation and listening comprehension through a variety of techniques such as poem reading and song dictations. Students will also learn how to utilize relevant techniques and materials to improve their pronunciation and listening skills further beyond the classroom.",
